00:07:27.814 --> 00:07:29.482
Originally, the joke in the fandom

00:07:29.482 --> 00:07:32.518
was that in the early eighties
when she debuted, she was created only

00:07:32.518 --> 00:07:36.389
for the purposes of selling more merch
